  "releaseNotes": "# [1.2.0](https://github.com/rdeneau/commitji/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0) (2025-07-07)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* 🏗️ use slashes instead of back slashes in semantic release prepare command as we are on Linux ([492d626](https://github.com/rdeneau/commitji/commit/492d626b4cfc8bae0bacbab4f9a2f78d2f7f47bb))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* 💄 don't highlight the completed steps ([5de489f](https://github.com/rdeneau/commitji/commit/5de489f9e888c63f7ac18a60774afdbc1d3021ff))\n* **search:** 👔 support emoji multiple codes ([6321415](https://github.com/rdeneau/commitji/commit/63214159f634b5d927f3d2b495b8c0a6faf04946))",
